  "id": 9,
  "title": "Body & health",
  "goal": "Name parts of the body, say what hurts and what illness you have, understand a doctor's advice and say what someone should do.",
  "intro": "Telugu talks about pain and illness as things that **happen to you**: *నాకు జ్వరం వచ్చింది* (a fever came to me), *నాకు తలనొప్పిగా ఉంది* (to me it is headache-ly). The person affected is in the dative case, just like *నాకు కావాలి* and *నాకు ఇష్టం*.\n\nYou'll also learn the very useful ending **-ఆలి** (-āli), 'must, should', which works the same for every person.",
